# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Content is edited from several places — Keystatic on Linux (Codespaces), and
# editors on Windows and macOS. Without this, a save on a different OS rewrites
# every line of a file and the real change disappears in the diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated: keep it out of diffs and review summaries.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
